eSimulator3D.start_simulation()\nPhysicalBoneSimulator3D.stop_simulation()\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2563589549/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2563857741","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100843#issuecomment-2563857741","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100843","id":2563857741,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y0V1N","user":{"login":"hunterkepley","id":9747105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3NDcxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9747105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hunterkepley","html_url":"https://github.com/hunterkepley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hunterkepley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hunterkepley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hunterkepley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hunterkepley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hunterkepley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hunterkepley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hunterkepley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hunterkepley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hunterkepley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-27T16:36:28Z","updated_at":"2024-12-27T17:06:03Z","body":"Ah! That fixed is\n\nI guess there’s 2 things to point out here:\n\n1. The prefix `physical_bones` is a confusing one to include now that the funcs moved to the simulator itself (which already has this prefix)\n2. Calling these functions on the Skeleton3D doesn’